cmd-ingameadmin-desc = Toggles in-game admin mode: you keep answering AHelps but lose every other admin tool, so you can play the round.
cmd-ingameadmin-help = Usage: ingameadmin
    Run it again to get your full admin permissions back. Readmin also ends the mode.

cmu-ingameadmin-not-admin = You are not an admin.
cmu-ingameadmin-deadminned = You are deadminned. Readmin first, then run ingameadmin.
cmu-ingameadmin-self-on = You are now an in-game admin. You keep the AHelp and lose every other admin tool. Run ingameadmin again to get them back.
cmu-ingameadmin-self-off = You left in-game admin mode and have your full admin permissions back.
cmu-ingameadmin-admin-announce-on = {$name} switched to in-game admin mode (AHelp only).
cmu-ingameadmin-admin-announce-off = {$name} left in-game admin mode.
